"markdown": "### Facebook Plus\n\nCustomize the Facebook app with a wide range of useful features to enhance your overall experience.\n\n**How to open settings:** Long-press any tab bar item at the bottom of the Facebook app.",
"useSpacing": false,
"class": "DepictionMarkdownView"
},
{
"class": "DepictionScreenshotsView",
"screenshots": [
{
