{
"markdown": "- **Key Features:**\n\n- **Ad Blocking & Interface Cleanup:** Block ads, hide suggested posts/groups/pages, remove \"People You May Know\", hide the Reels scrollbar, hide Stories, and remove Threads promo cards.\n- **Media Downloads:** Direct download buttons when viewing Reels and Stories.\n- **Security & Privacy:** Ghost view (anonymous viewing without read receipts), an overlay hide button in Reels, disable video autoplay, and enable confirmation prompts before liking posts and Reels.\n- **Customization & System:** True OLED dark mode, diverse custom app icons (Chill, Dreamy, Fab, Fierce, Lovey, Vaporwave,...), open external links in Safari, plus cache management and language options.",
"useSpacing": false,
"class": "DepictionMarkdownView"
